@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Liveness & Readiness Health Checks + Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 2. Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/SmartParking/GetAllClients
Accept: application/json

###
